  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan soul searches Jun Shen Guang and learns that Central Continent’s Four Xunzi are time path Gu Immortals, quadruplets found young by Spirit Butterfly Valley and specially nurtured: three older brothers and one younger sister, Shang Xunzi, Zhong Xunzi, Xia Xunzi, and Xun Guo Zi.",
      "chapters": [
        1628
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_jun_shen_guang",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_shang_xunzi",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_spirit_butterfly_valley",
        "char_zhong_xunzi",
        "char_xia_xunzi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "All Four Xunzi share rank seven cultivation and a combination technique that can briefly contest a rank eight. They jointly activate Present and Past Pavilion against Fang Yuan’s immemorial year beasts. Xun Guo Zi smiles that the pavilion controls the situation and that Fang Yuan is not a threat while his beasts stay scattered. When Fang Yuan reaches the pavilion as an immemorial year monkey, she says nervously that it is anchored in the River of Time and cannot be moved. Fang Yuan still wrecks the pavilion and kicks the Four Xunzi into the river.",
      "chapters": [
        1629
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-river-of-time-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_present_and_past_pavilion",
        "loc_river_of_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On Eternal Yacht, she shouts that Fang Yuan is fighting instead of running and must have vicious plans. When time cutting edge threatens Qing Ye, she jumps in front of him, takes the hit, and falls dead on the deck. Her brothers stay calm at first because they expect to revive her and gain Qing Ye’s favor, but Qing Ye says their revival method will not work against this move.",
      "chapters": [
        1633
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-shielding-qing-ye",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_eternal_yacht",
        "char_qing_ye"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a later River of Time confrontation, only three Xunzi occupy Present and Past Pavilion. Narration states that Fang Yuan’s earlier use of time cutting edge killed Xun Guo Zi, their revival methods failed, and only three remain.",
      "chapters": [
        1694
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "three-remaining",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan again approaches the River of Time after rebirth, Xun Guo Zi is once more among the Four Xunzi in Present and Past Pavilion: the youngest and only sister, rank seven time path, from Spirit Butterfly Valley, and not a Heavenly Court member though Fairy Zi Wei promoted them. She asks what Shang Xunzi saw, has a vibrant and cheerful nature, and still keeps the mission serious. She giggles that even if her brothers die, as long as she survives they will be revived.",
      "chapters": [
        1753
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pavilion-watch",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_fairy_zi_wei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Facing Myriad Year Flying Warship, she shows fright that the pavilion’s sawtooth whirlpool cannot break the ship’s defensive light. When the whirlpool turns into silver-white rapids under Fang Yuan’s control, she shouts that the situation is bad as the warship charges the pavilion.",
      "chapters": [
        1805
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sawtooth-whirlpool-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_myriad_year_flying_warship"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Myriad Year Flying Warship shatters Present and Past Pavilion. The Four Xunzi fall into the River of Time and, without the pavilion, are all killed by Fang Yuan shortly afterward.",
      "chapters": [
        1806
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-in-the-river-of-time",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
